# Shared secret for the authenticated publishing path (POST /api/create-post).
# The same value must also be set as POCHUTYVSE_PUBLISH_TOKEN in
# /home/deploy/seo-bot/.env (SEO Bot V1's client-side copy).
# Minimum 32 bytes (UTF-8); generate with, e.g., `openssl rand -base64 32`.
# Never commit a real value here — this file documents the variable only.
POCHUTYVSE_PUBLISH_TOKEN=
